# (the Wrath has already finished, so they live), and both Travelers and the Wrath are in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Doomed Traveler
Doomed Traveler
Wrath of God
Plains
Plains
Plains
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

