Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#4.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wrath of God.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T7 Bot1.Main2]

